  "prefLabel": "Rev 902.02 Part Year Residency",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Rev 902.02 Part Year Residency. A person claiming to be a New Hampshire part year resident shall provide documentation using the same criteria in Rev 902.01, above, showing an intent to reside in another state for a portion of the year.\n\nSource. #5947, eff 12-29-94; ss by #6321, eff 8-22-96; ss by #8137, eff 8-10-04; ss by #10211, eff 10-24-12; ss by #13443, eff 8-12-22",
